helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bg	Функция Exp [динамична]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150616				0	bg	\<bookmark_value\>Exp, функция\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150616				0	bg	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03080201.xhp\" name=\"Функция Exp [динамична]\"\>Функция Exp [динамична]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3155555				0	bg	Връща основата на натуралния логаритъм (e = 2,718282…), повдигната на зададена степен.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150984				0	bg	Синтаксис:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145315				0	bg	Exp (Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154347				0	bg	Връщана стойност:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	bg	Double				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154760				0	bg	Параметри:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	bg	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> Any numeric expression that specifies the power that you want to raise "e" to (the base of natural logarithms). The power must be for both single-precision numbers less than or equal to 88.02969 and double-precision numbers less than or equal to 709.782712893, since $[officename] Basic returns an Overflow error for numbers exceeding these values.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156280				0	bg	Пример:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3153193				0	bg	Sub ExampleLogExp				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864				0	bg	Dim dValue As Double				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3145172				0	bg	const b1 = 12.345e12				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3159254				0	bg	const b2 = 1.345e34				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3147287				0	bg	dValue = Exp(Log(b1) + Log(b2))				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3161832				0	bg	MsgBox "" & dValue & Chr(13) & (b1 * b2), 0, "Умножение чрез логаритъм"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151112				0	bg	End Sub				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	tit				0	bg	Оператор DefInt [динамичен]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149811				0	bg	\<bookmark_value\>DefInt, оператор\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149811				0	bg	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03101500.xhp\" name=\"Оператор DefInt [динамичен]\"\>Оператор DefInt [динамичен]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	par_id3149762				0	bg	Операторът DefInt установява подразбиран тип данни според диапазон от букви в случай, че не е зададена ключова дума или знак за деклариране на тип.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148686				0	bg	Синтаксис:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	par_id3156023				0	bg	Defxxx Characterrange1[, Characterrange2[,...]]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156344				0	bg	Параметри:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	par_id3147560				0	bg	\<emph\>Characterrange:\</emph\> букви, определящи диапазона от променливи, за които искате да зададете подразбиран тип данни.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	par_id3150398				0	bg	\<emph\>xxx:\</emph\> ключова дума, дефинираща подразбирания тип данни:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365				0	bg	\<emph\>Ключова дума:\</emph\> Подразбиран тип данни				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03101500.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863				0	bg	\<emph\>DefInt:\</emph\> Integer				20200411 15:09:53
