helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3145066				0	bg	Връща натуралния логаритъм на число.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159414				0	bg	Синтаксис:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3154760				0	bg	Log (Number)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149457				0	bg	Връщана стойност:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	bg	Double				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151211				0	bg	Параметри:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3151041				0	bg	\<emph\>Number:\</emph\> числов израз, чийто натурален логаритъм искате да изчислите.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3150869				0	bg	Натуралният логаритъм е логаритъм с основа e. Това е константа с приближителна стойност 2,718282…				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3153968				0	bg	Можете да пресмятате логаритми с всякаква основа n за всяко число x, като разделите натуралния логаритъм на x на натуралния логаритъм на n, както следва:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3145420				0	bg	Log n(x) = Log(x) / Log(n)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155131				0	bg	Пример:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3152463				0	bg	Sub ExampleLogExp				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3145750				0	bg	Dim a As Double				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3151116				0	bg	Dim Const b1 = 12.345e12				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3146985				0	bg	Dim Const b2 = 1.345e34				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3148616				0	bg	a = Exp(Log(b1) + Log(b2))				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3149262				0	bg	MsgBox "" & a & Chr(13) & (b1 * b2), 0, "Умножение чрез логаритъм"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080202.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411				0	bg	End Sub				20200411 15:09:53
