helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3149456				0	bg	\<emph\>n:\</emph\> числов израз, който задава желания брой на знаците в резултата. Ако \<emph\>n\</emph\> = 0, се връща низ с нулева дължина. Максималната разрешена стойност е 65535.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3150791				0	bg	Следващият пример преобразува дата от формат ГГГГ-ММ-ДД в американския формат ММ/ДД/ГГГГ.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	hd_id3125863				0	bg	Пример:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3144761				0	bg	Sub ExampleUSDate				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3153194				0	bg	Dim sInput As String				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3154217				0	bg	Dim sUS_date As String				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3150448				0	bg	sInput = InputBox("Моля, въведете дата в международния формат „ГГГГ-ММ-ДД“")				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3149203				0	bg	sUS_date = Mid(sInput, 6, 2)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	bg	sUS_date = sUS_date & "/"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3153770				0	bg	sUS_date = sUS_date & Right(sInput, 2)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3161833				0	bg	sUS_date = sUS_date & "/"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3147215				0	bg	sUS_date = sUS_date & Left(sInput, 4)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3149666				0	bg	MsgBox sUS_date				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120303.xhp	0	help	par_id3153138				0	bg	End Sub				20200411 15:09:53
