helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_import_export_limitations.xhp	0	help	par_id0811200801491971				0	bg	Един пример за разликите между Calc и Excel е работата с логически стойности. Въведете TRUE в клетките A1 и A2. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_import_export_limitations.xhp	0	help	par_id0811200801491973				0	bg	В Calc формулата =A1+A2 дава резултат 2, както и формулата =SUM(A1;A2).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_import_export_limitations.xhp	0	help	par_id0811200801491972				0	bg	В Excel формулата =A1+A2 дава резултат 2, но формулата =SUM(A1,A2) дава 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\ms_import_export_limitations.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	bg	For a detailed overview about converting documents to and from Microsoft Office format, see the \<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Documentation/OOoAuthors_User_Manual/Migration_Guide\"\>Migration Guide\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
