helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150669				0	bg	Без сбиване				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01150100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150503				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_ASIAN_LAYOUT_RB_NO_COMP\"\>Указва, че знаците никога няма да се сближават.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
