helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id9701528				0	bg	%PRODUCTNAME използва само цветовия модел RGB за цветно печатане. Елементите за управление за CMYK са предназначени само за удобно въвеждане на цветове във формат CMYK.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778801				0	bg	Color Field				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778801				0	bg	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:Control:ColorPicker:ColorField\"\>Кликнете в палитрата от цветове, за да изберете нов цвят .\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778802				0	bg	Плъзгач за цветове				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778802				0	bg	Click any of the six option buttons Red, Green, Blue, Hue, Saturation, or Brightness. The color slider changes to show the available range of values. \<ahelp hid=\"cui:Control:ColorPicker:ColorSlider\"\>In the color slider, you will see the range of values that you can change, depending on the selected option button. Click inside the color slider to change values in the big color field.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778803				0	bg	Предварителен преглед на текущия цвят				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778803				0	bg	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:Control:ColorPicker:ColorPreview\"\>In the left half of the preview field, you will always see the current result of your work in this dialog.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778803b				0	bg	Предишен цвят				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778803b				0	bg	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:Control:ColorPicker:ColorPrevious\"\>In the right half of the preview field, you will see the original color from the parent tab, \<emph\>Colors\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778804				0	bg	RGB				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778804				0	bg	These set of controls allow to choose a color in the RGB color model, where red, green, and blue are combined to produce a color.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778805				0	bg	Червено				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778805				0	bg	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:MetricField:ColorPicker:Red\"\>Sets the Red color value in the RGB color model.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778806				0	bg	Зелено				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778806				0	bg	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:RadioButton:ColorPicker:Green\"\>Sets the Green color value in the RGB color model.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
