helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	hd_id5566778816				0	bg	Жълто				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010501.xhp	0	help	par_id5566778816				0	bg	            \<ahelp hid=\"cui:MetricField:ColorPicker:Yellow\"\>Sets the Yellow color value in the CMYK color model.\</ahelp\>        				20200411 15:09:53
