helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id5483870				0	bg	\<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Documentation/How_Tos/Regular_Expressions_in_Calc\"\>Wiki page about regular expressions in Calc\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
