helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01010202.xhp	0	help	par_id3145139				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:NUMERICFIELD:TP_LAB_FMT:FLD_PAPER_HEIGHT\"\>Displays the height of the paper which the labels or business cards are ordered. If you are defining a custom format, enter a value here. If this value is zero for sheet format, the paper height is calculated from the height of the label.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
