helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_pagenumbers.xhp	0	help	par_id9404278				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Най-отгоре на страницата (горен колонтитул)\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
