helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A5				0	bg	Използване на синтаксис за Outer Join "{OJ }"				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN105A9				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Използване на превключващи последователности за външни съединения. Синтаксисът им е {oj outer-join}\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN105BE				0	bg	Пример:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabaadvpropdat.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C1				0	bg	select Article.* from {oj item LEFT OUTER JOIN orders ON item.no=orders.ANR}				20200411 15:09:53
