helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabawiz02access.xhp	0	help	par_id1142772				0	bg	See also the English Wiki page \<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/MSA-Base_Faq\"\>wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/MSA-Base_Faq\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabawiz02access.xhp	0	help	par_idN10544				0	bg	Файл с база от данни на Microsoft Access				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\dabawiz02access.xhp	0	help	par_idN10548				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Задава пътя до файла с базата от данни.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
