helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153912				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:RADIOBUTTON:TP_LEGEND_POS:RBT_TOP\"\>Разполага легендата отгоре в диаграмата.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
