helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id3859675				0	bg	=ISNUMBER(VLOOKUP(1;A1:C1;3)) => FALSE (C1, преди беше TRUE)				20200411 15:09:53
