helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id1623889				0	bg	=ISTEXT(C1) => FALSE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id7781914				0	bg	=ISTEXT(VLOOKUP(1;A1:C1;2)) => FALSE (B1, преди беше TRUE)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id300912				0	bg	=ISTEXT(VLOOKUP(1;A1:C1;3)) => FALSE (C1)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id9534592				0	bg	=ISBLANK(B1) => TRUE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id4969328				0	bg	=ISBLANK(C1) => FALSE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id9635914				0	bg	=ISBLANK(VLOOKUP(1;A1:C1;2)) => TRUE (B1, преди беше FALSE)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id2476577				0	bg	=ISBLANK(VLOOKUP(1;A1:C1;3)) => FALSE (C1)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id4217047				0	bg	Обърнете внимание, че Microsoft Excel се държи различно и винаги дава число като резултат от обръщение към празна клетка или формула с резултат празна клетка. Например:				20200411 15:09:53
