helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3154317				0	bg	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DEC2OCT(100;4)\</item\> връща 0144.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	bm_id3083446				0	bg	\<bookmark_value\>ERF, функция\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Гаусов интеграл на грешките\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
