helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152927				0	bg	\<bookmark_value\>GESTEP, функция\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>числа;по-големи или равни\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152927				0	bg	GESTEP				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3150763				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_GESTEP\"\>Резултатът е 1, ако аргументът \<item type=\"literal\"\>Число\</item\> е по-голям или равен на \<item type=\"literal\"\>Стъпка\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150879				0	bg	Синтаксис				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060115.xhp	0	help	par_id3145212				0	bg	GESTEP(Число; Стъпка)				20200411 15:09:53
