helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3153122				0	bg	\<item type=\"input\"\>=AVEDEV(A1:A50)\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145824				0	bg	\<bookmark_value\>AVERAGE, функция\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145824				0	bg	AVERAGE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3150482				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MITTELWERT\"\>Връща средното аритметично на аргументите.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146943				0	bg	Синтаксис				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3154679				0	bg	AVERAGE(Число1; Число2;… Число30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3150741				0	bg	\<emph\>Число1, Число2,… Число30\</emph\> са стойности или области.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153039				0	bg	Пример				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3151232				0	bg	\<item type=\"input\"\>=AVERAGE(A1:A50)\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148754				0	bg	\<bookmark_value\>AVERAGEA, функция\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148754				0	bg	AVERAGEA				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3145138				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MITTELWERTA\"\>Връща средната стойност на аргументите. Стойността на текста е 0.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153326				0	bg	Синтаксис				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3149734				0	bg	AVERAGEA(Стойност1; Стойност2;… Стойност30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3155260				0	bg	\<emph\>Стойност1; Стойност2;… Стойност30\</emph\> са стойности или области. Текстът има стойност 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149504				0	bg	Пример				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3150864				0	bg	\<item type=\"input\"\>=AVERAGEA(A1:A50)\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148754K1				0	bg	\<bookmark_value\>AVERAGEIF function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148754K1				0	bg	AVERAGEIF				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3145138K1				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MITTELWERTB\"\>Average the values of cells in a range that meet a criteria.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153326K1				0	bg	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3149734K1				0	bg	AVERAGEIF( Reference R ; Criterion C [ ; Reference A ] )				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3155260K1				0	bg	 If reference A is omitted, averages the values of cells in the reference range R that meet the Criterion C. If reference A is given, averages the values of cells of a range that is constructed using the top left cell of reference A and applying the dimensions, shape and size, of reference R.  Does not accept constant values as reference parameters.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3145139K1				0	bg	If no cell in range R matches the Criterion C, an Error is returned. If no Numbers are in the range to be averaged, an Error is returned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149504K1				0	bg	Examples				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3150864K1				0	bg	\<item type=\"input\"\>=AVERAGEIF(A1:A50;">"0)\</item\>will return the average of A1:A50 of all positive values in the range.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148754K2				0	bg	\<bookmark_value\>AVERAGEIFS function\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148754K2				0	bg	AVERAGEIFS				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3145138K2				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MITTELWERTC\"\>Average the values of cells that meet multiple criteria in multiple ranges.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153326K2				0	bg	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3149734K2				0	bg	AVERAGEIFS( Reference A ; Reference R1 ; Criterion C1 [ ; Reference R2 ; Criterion C2 ]... )				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3155260K2				0	bg	Averages the values of cells in the reference range A that meet the Criterion C1 in the reference range R1 and the Criterion C2 in the reference range R2, and so on.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3145139K2				0	bg	All reference ranges shall have the same dimension and size, else an Error is returned. A logical AND is applied between each array result of each selection; a cell of reference range A is evaluated only if the same position in each array is the result of a Criterion match. If no numbers are in the result set to be averaged, an Error is returned.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149504K2				0	bg	Example				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3150864K2				0	bg	\<item type=\"input\"\>=AVERAGEIFS(A1:A50;B1:B25;">"0)\</item\>+will return the average of A1:A50 if all cells in the range B1 to B25 are greater than 0.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153933				0	bg	\<bookmark_value\>MODE, функция\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>най-често срещана стойност\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153933				0	bg	MODE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3153085				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MODALWERT\"\>Връща най-често срещаната стойност в набор от данни.\</ahelp\> Ако съществуват няколко стойности с еднаква честота, се връща най-малката. Ако никоя стойност не се повтаря, възниква грешка.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153003				0	bg	Синтаксис				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3155950				0	bg	MODE(Число1; Число2;… Число30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3150337				0	bg	\<emph\>Число1; Число2;… Число30\</emph\> са числови стойности или области.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153571				0	bg	Пример				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3153733				0	bg	\<item type=\"input\"\>=MODE(A1:A50)\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149879				0	bg	\<bookmark_value\>NEGBINOMDIST, функция\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>отрицателно биномно разпределение\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149879				0	bg	NEGBINOMDIST				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3155437				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_NEGBINOMVERT\"\>Изчислява отрицателното биномно разпределение.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145351				0	bg	Синтаксис				20200411 15:09:53
