helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3151309				0	bg	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_FACTDOUBLE\"\>Връща двойния факториел на число.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154666				0	bg	Синтаксис				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3155121				0	bg	FACTDOUBLE(Число)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id3158440	40			0	bg	Връща \<emph\>Число\</emph\>\<emph\>!!\</emph\>, двойния факториел на \<emph\>Число\</emph\>, където \<emph\>Число\</emph\> е цяло число, по-голямо или равно на нула.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2480849				0	bg	За четни числа FACTDOUBLE(n) връща:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id4181951				0	bg	2*4*6*8* ... *n				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2927335				0	bg	За нечетни числа FACTDOUBLE(n) връща:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id2107303				0	bg	1*3*5*7* ... *n				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	par_id4071779				0	bg	FACTDOUBLE(0) връща 1 по дефиниция.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060116.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154622				0	bg	Пример				20200411 15:09:53
