helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3166440				0	bg	COSH(Число)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150710				0	bg	Връща хиперболичния косинус на \<emph\>Число\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153234				0	bg	Пример				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3154099				0	bg	\<item type=\"input\"\>=COSH(0)\</item\> връща 1, хиперболичния косинус на 0.				20200411 15:09:53
