helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154451				0	bg	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option+Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+клавишите със стрелки				20200411 15:09:53
