helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150952				0	bg	Изберете \<emph\>Вмъкване - Указатели и таблици - Указатели и таблици\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150509				0	bg	On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Index/Table\</item\> tab, select the name of the user-defined index that you created in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3146881				0	bg	Изберете желаните настройки.				20200411 15:09:53
