helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indices_userdef.xhp	0	help	par_id3150720				0	bg	If you want to use a different paragraph style as a table of contents entry, select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Styles\</item\>, and then click the (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) button next to the box. Click the style in the list, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>>>\</item\> or the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\><<\</item\> button to define the outline level for the paragraph style.				20200411 15:09:53
