helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3152765				0	bg	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Anchor\</item\> area, select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>To page\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149844				0	bg	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Size\</item\> area, set the dimensions of the frame.				20200411 15:09:53
