helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3155918				0	bg	Можете да зададете автоматично номериране на еднотипни елементи в документа, например цитати.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3149829				0	bg	Въведете текста, на който желаете да припишете номерацията, например "Цитат номер".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3155048				0	bg	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert - Fields - Other\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Variables\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3156240				0	bg	Click "Number range" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\number_sequence.xhp	0	help	par_id3153363				0	bg	Type "Quotation" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Name\</item\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
