helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155571				0	bg	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Outline Numbering\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering\</item\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
